Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.07,0:00:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Every night I live and die  ♪ 每个夜晚我都在生死间徘徊 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.91,0:00:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the party to my bones  ♪ 感受派对深入骨髓 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.01,0:00:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch the wasters blow the speakers  ♪ 看着废物们震坏音响设备 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.42,0:00:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Spill my guts beneath the outdoor light  ♪ 在户外灯光下倾吐心声 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.75,0:00:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just another graceless night  ♪ 又一个狼狈无措的夜晚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate the headlines and the weather  ♪ 我讨厌头条新闻和天气 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.93,0:00:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm 19 and I'm on fire  ♪ 十九岁的我正染着热血 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.21,0:00:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But when we're dancing I'm alright  ♪ 但当我们起舞时 我才感觉自在 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.05,0:00:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just another graceless night  ♪ 又一个狼狈无措的夜晚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.95,0:00:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you lost enough?  ♪ 你是否已足够迷茫？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.47,0:00:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Have another drink get lost in us  ♪ 再来一杯 迷失在我们之中 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.57,0:00:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how we get notorious oh  ♪ 这就是我们声名狼藉的方式 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.65,0:00:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause I don't know  ♪ 因为我不知道 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.40,0:00:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If they keep tellin' me where to go  ♪ 如果他们一直告诉我该何去何从 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.42,0:00:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll blow my brains out to the radio oh  ♪ 我会随着广播音乐崩溃疯狂 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the things we're taking  ♪ 我们攫取的一切 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.05,0:01:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause we are young and we're ashamed  ♪ 因为我们年轻且羞愧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Send us to perfect places  ♪ 将我们送去往完美之地吧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.35,0:01:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our heroes fading  ♪ 所有的英雄都已逝去 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can't stand to be alone  ♪ 现在我无法忍受独自一人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.87,0:01:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to perfect places  ♪ 让我们前往完美之地 ♪
